# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (Render fallback image). Keeps the image small and keeps
# anything local or secret out of it: the app reads every setting at run time from the host.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
docs
